    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Death has always fascinated you. You have studied that grim subject alongside the members of the Covenant of the Grave, examining the macabre with scientific rigor. Through this work, you have built up knowledge of medicine, necromancy, and history.</p><p><strong>Ability Scores:</strong> Strength, Intelligence, Wisdom</p><p><strong>Feat:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.compendium-owidyn.backgrounds-feats.Item.kG9sa51ViSNI7eQG]{Arcane Undertaker}</p><p><strong>Skill Proficiencies:</strong> History and Medicine</p><p><strong>Tool Proficiency:</strong> @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulHerbalismK]{Herbalism Kit}</p><p><strong>Equipment:</strong> <em>Choose A or B:</em> (A) @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbwepDagger0000]{Dagger}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbtulHerbalismK]{Herbalism Kit}, @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagBook0000000]{Book} (anatomy), @UUID[Compendium.dnd5e.equipment24.Item.phbagShovel00000]{Shovel}, 16 GP; or (B) 50 GP</p>",
